      <div class="sec-h">
        <h2 id="intl-credit-bonds" tabindex="-1">{{ t('Credit & bond stress', '信用与债券压力') }} {{ help('Credit spreads = the extra yield emerging-market bonds pay above comparable Treasuries, in percentage points. Change comparison = the standardized 20-day change relative to prior changes in its trailing history (up to 2 years; current observation excluded). Above/below usual uses the existing +/-0.1 score band. This is not raw spread direction: above usual can still be narrowing. Missing scores remain unavailable. EM high-yield source: BAML EM High Yield index. Regional spreads: BAML regional subindices. Inversion board: 10-year minus 2-year yield, falling back to 3-month where 2-year is absent. Counts include only sovereign curves with supplied data; coverage can be partial. EM spread history collected since Jul 2023 (data-vendor cap) — long-run comparisons build up over time.', '信用利差 = 新兴市场债券相对同期美债的超额收益率（百分点）。变动比较 = 当前20日变动相对历史20日变动的标准化偏离（最多2年历史，不含当前观测）。高于或低于常态沿用正负0.1的分数区间。这不是利差的原始方向：高于常态时利差仍可能收窄。缺少分数时显示不可用。新兴市场高收益来源：美银美林新兴市场高收益指数。地区利差：美银美林地区子指数。倒挂看板：10年减2年期收益率；缺少2年期时采用3月期。计数仅涵盖有数据的主权曲线，覆盖可能不完整。新兴市场利差数据自2023年7月起收集（数据供应商限制）——长期比较随时间积累。') }}</h2>
        <span class="sub">{{ t('Are lenders charging more for risk?', '贷款方是否在为风险索取更高溢价？') }}</span>
      </div>

      <div class="ird-spread-grid">
        <!-- EM HY -->
        {%- set em_hy_v = em_hy.get('value') %}
        {%- set em_hy_vel = em_hy.get('vel_20d_z') %}
        <div class="ird-spread-card">
